cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below. If
  you use the dataset it produces, cite the Zenodo dataset deposit
  instead (see that deposit's own README for its citation).
title: "hiberno-english-grounded-reader"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Edirisinghe
    given-names: Rasika
    affiliation: University College Cork
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0008-4673-0259"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mrHendrixSL/hiberno-english-grounded-reader"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Extraction pipeline, schema definitions, and evaluation code for a
  hybrid (rule-based + LLM) structured-data extraction system applied to
  "A Dictionary of Hiberno-English" (Dolan, 2020, 3rd edn). Companion
  code for the dataset deposited on Zenodo and the accompanying journal
  article.
